# online-portfolio — agent context

**PRIORITY #1: SECURITY** — see `.cursor/rules/security-first.mdc` and `docs/AGENT_GUIDE.md`.

**Git:** never commit, push, checkout, or merge unless the user explicitly asks — see `.cursor/rules/git-workflow.mdc`.

**Status:** Epic 0 foundation ✅ — Docker + CI PR (DEV-006) + deploy (DEV-007/007b) + DNS prod (DEV-011). Next: Epic 1.5. Read `docs/AGENT_GUIDE.md` and `docs/BACKLOG.md` before coding.

## Hard rules

- **Security:** tenant isolation, no IDOR, secrets server-only, validate inputs, invite-only auth
- **BFF:** browser → Nuxt proxy → API — never direct Render from browser
- **Auth:** ASP.NET Identity **completo** + JWT on API; roles via `AspNetRoles` / `AspNetUserRoles`
- **No** Supabase Auth, **no** `@nuxtjs/supabase`, **no** anon key in frontend
- **Admin login:** only `app.onlineportfolio.com.br` — not tenant subdomains
- **Public sites:** `{slug}.onlineportfolio.com.br` per tenant — UI custom + **ultra animado** in `components/public/tenants/{slug}/` only ([ADR-018](docs/ADR-018-frontend-ui-motion-stack.md))
- **Admin UI:** standardized in `components/app/` — **Nuxt UI**, minimal motion — never per-tenant ([ADR-018](docs/ADR-018-frontend-ui-motion-stack.md))
- **Email v1:** Resend `mail@onlineportfolio.com.br` send-only — no mailbox; Reply-To para respostas ([ADR-017](docs/ADR-017-resend-transactional-email.md))
- **Secrets:** never commit `.env` or API keys; service role only on backend

## Roles (v1)

`PlatformAdmin` (add users, any tenant) · `Owner` · `Editor` — invite-only, no self-signup

## Order

Epic 0 scaffold → Epic 1.5 (login + add user) → Epic 1 (public sites). See BACKLOG sprint order.

## Repository

**Monorepo** — one Git repo; `frontend/` (Vercel) + `backend/` (Render). Not separate repos.

## Commits

Conventional Commits — see `.cursor/rules/conventional-commits.mdc`

## Git flow & CI

- **Workflows separados:** `ci-backend.yml` + `ci-frontend.yml` (✅ PR CI + coverage comments) + `deploy-*` (planned).
- **Deploy:** production only on `main` ([docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md)); no staging stack in v1.
- **Before merge:** green CI + cross-stack review; PR coverage comments when CI runs. Checklist: `docs/AGENT_GUIDE.md` · `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`

